You can now achieve this behavior with the [`panel`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/panel/js/) widget in InstantSearch.js 3:

```js
const pagination = instantsearch.widgets.panel({
  hidden: ({ results }) => results.nbPages === 1,
})(instantsearch.widgets.pagination);

search.addWidget(
  pagination({
    container: '#pagination',
  })
);
```
